An '''ooze''' is an amorphous or mutable creature, usually mindless.
Typical forms for these creatures include living puddles and blobs of gelatin.

Since their bodies tend to have no set form, they are often immune to [[critical hit]]s, [[prone|knockdown]], [[paralysis]], and [[sneak attack]]s. As mindless creatures, they are generally immune to [[mind-affecting]] spells. The substance from which they are made tends to give them 100% [[immunity]] to [[electrical damage]] and [[poison]].<!-- These are the defenses from the "Ooze Properties" creature skin. However, this might be an unused item. -->
However, these defenses may vary from ooze to ooze, and are more a guideline for [[custom content]] creators than for the few oozes defined by [[BioWare]].

This [[racial type]] was added with the [[Hordes of the Underdark]] expansion. As a consequence (and probably an oversight), this race is not an option for a ranger's (or Harper scout's) [[favored enemy]].

